<title>HONG KONG: ING Baring sets warrants on HK Telecom.</title>
<headline>ING Baring sets warrants on HK Telecom.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Baring Financial Products said on Monday it has launched 240 million American-style call warrants on shares of Hong Kong Telecommunications Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$17.70     PREMIUM	 16.05 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.2841    GEARING	 6.23x</p>
<p> LAUNCH DATE	 02.JUN.97    LISTING DATE  26.JUN.97</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  02.JUN.98    PAYDATE	 24.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  4,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$17.70</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH OR PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
</text>
